            "review_title": "Review at Pavilion Skybar",
            "review_text": "Smith Johnson\nUnited States3 contributions\n0\nA Wonderful Rooftop Experience at Pavilion Skybar\nJul 2026 • Couples\nPavilion Skybar is definitely one of the best places to enjoy Hanoi from above. The atmosphere is stylish and relaxing, with breathtaking panoramic views that become even more magical at suúnet.\n\nThe cocktails were beautifully presented and well-balanced, and the food was fresh and delicious. What impressed me the most was the warm and attentive service, the staff were friendly, professional, and made us feel welcome throughout the evening.\n\nWhether you’re looking for a romantic date, a night out with friends, or simply a place to unwind with a great view, Pavilion Skybar is an excellent choice. I would happily come back again and highly recommend it to anyone visiting Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten July 28, 2026",
